      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxq4bhezas2q",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "GPT-4 was the undisputed best model in the world for a full year and we all debated whether anyone could catch up or if OpenAI had some secret formula that nobody else knew about.\n\nNow there are are 19 AI models that can run on a modern smartphone that are better than GPT-4!",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxq4bhezas2q",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-13T03:39:12.245Z",
      "likes": 203,
      "replies": 7,
      "reposts": 30,
      "score": 6.7,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.4,
        "recency": 0.6,
        "age_hours": 63.1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxrncnjjjk2q",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Using Gemini 4 makes you realize how many other models must be distilling Claude/GPT (or using a similar training pipeline). It feels quite different than other models.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxrncnjjjk2q",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-13T18:16:45.590Z",
      "likes": 146,
      "replies": 8,
      "reposts": 4,
      "score": 6.6,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.2,
        "recency": 0.7,
        "age_hours": 48.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxwf7wo7rs2x",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "The sudden collapse of the value of Chain-of-Thought (even summarized CoT) in the agentic era changes working with AI.\n\nEffectively steering AIs and getting any sort of observability now requires you to ask for interim outputs & tests, and to use AI help to troubleshoot problems you find.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxwf7wo7rs2x",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-15T15:35:23.276Z",
      "likes": 44,
      "replies": 5,
      "reposts": 3,
      "score": 6.5,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.8,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 3.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxudeo2mo22p",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Hello, Georgia Tech's Nexus supercomputer is online. It builds out a major part of the NSF's public AI computing ecosystem.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mxudeo2mo22p",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-14T19:56:55.057Z",
      "likes": 36,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 5,
      "score": 5.9,
      "score_parts": {
